 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "leases lists [start, end] pairs (start < end), each wanting one car during [start, end); the fleet has cars cars with ids 1..cars. Process reservations by start time (ties by input index). A car whose current reservation ends at or before the start is free. Give each reservation the smallest free car id; when no car is free the reservation is rejected and gets -1 (it occupies nothing). Return the car id or -1 for every reservation in input order.",
  "provenance": [
